=2 Walkthrough
* Shamarhaan is the {p:Puppetmaster} standing near the Fountain in {z:Bastok Markets}. Talk to him as a Puppetmaster to begin the quest.
* Farm {p:Trolls|Category:Troll} for the {i:testimony|Pup. Testimony|2333}. Specific Trolls drop it.
** {z:Halvung} {p:Survival Guide} and exit to be near 2 spawns
* Trade to Shamarhaan to initiate the {z:Navukgo Execution Chamber} BC (you will be warped there), where just like the {p:Maat} fight, you'll have to fight Shamarhaan to break level cap limit.
** Upon arrival at {z:Navukgo Execution Chamber}, trade the Testimony to the Decorative Bronze Gate to begin battle.
** Shamarhaan will be accompanied by his Automaton {m:Valkeng}, so you will need to prepare for a battle with both of them.
** Battle Time Limit: 10mins
** If you have the {k:"Rhapsody in Umber"} Key Item, you are able to summon {p:Trust Magic} to aid you.
** Bring Shamarhaan down to -20% hp and you should win the battle.

=2 Notes
* Does not need to be completed (for level limit increasing) if the player has already completed {q:New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await|New Worlds Await} or better.

